  "material_differences": [
    "PH login reader only consumes the first 12 body bytes; current request has 18 bytes including CurrentZoneHostIp and LoginPlatform.",
    "PH empty-free-prop login response ends after FreePropCount (28-byte body); current adds IsNewbie and AreaId after the counted free props (33-byte empty body candidate).",
    "Current PlayerInfo has EvolutionPoint and EvolutionGameTime immediately after Experience; PH serializer places two datetimes there. Copying that serializer shifts subsequent fields.",
    "Current PlayerInfo has 78 fields including PlayerGeniusFlagDb with 1024 bytes of nested flags and CreditScore. PH shorter serializer cannot represent this structure.",
    "Current NtfPlayerProps metadata independently confirms max 5 PropInfo per notification and a 14-field, 70-byte fixed PropInfo layout. Similar names do not validate PH item IDs, GID hierarchy, locations, permanent durations or defaults."
  ],
